  "historyNote": "#1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss and moved by #5033, eff 12-27-90 (see Env-A 101.48) New. #5033, eff 12-27-90 (from Env-A 101.46); ss and moved by #6057-A, eff 6-30-95 (from Env-A 101.47); renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.145), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304, (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.96), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.98) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
